## 🛠️ Quick Commands

```bash
# Validate Python
python3 -m py_compile file.py

# Validate XML
python3 -c "import xml.etree.ElementTree as ET; ET.parse('file.xml')"

# Git
git add -A && git commit -m "type: description"
git push origin main
```

---

## 📝 Commit Convention

```
type: description
# feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, test, chore
```

